{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F8T1DM9xHC6m5dZEAaBG1U","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Cookie renewal\n2\t\n3\tMove the renewal credential out of the request body and into an HttpOnly cookie, so page\n4\tscripts cannot read it.\n5\t\n6\t- Server: `renew` reads the cookie when the body has no token (shipped).\n7\t- Web client: posts `{}` to `/renew` (shipped).\n8\t- Safety: the change is transport-only. Proved in `proofs/Renewal.lean`: R-1, R-2, R-3, all\n9\t  with no `sorry`.\n10\t- End-to-end: a 25-minute session on staging renewed at natural expiry.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6d764b45-a594-40cc-aa39-e43d050a2c21","uuid":"df7c45a8-b9a0-4d0e-be17-141b0712208c","timestamp":"2026-10-28T15:12:58.783Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/tmp.Anf4p4lr1b/DESIGN.md","content":"# Cookie renewal\n\nMove the renewal credential out of the request body and into an HttpOnly cookie, so page\nscripts cannot read it.\n\n- Server: `renew` reads the cookie when the body has no token (shipped).\n- Web client: posts `{}` to `/renew` (shipped).\n- Safety: the change is transport-only. Proved in `proofs/Renewal.lean`: R-1, R-2, R-3, all\n  with no `sorry`.\n- End-to-end: a 25-minute session on staging renewed at natural expiry.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01F8T1DM9xHC6m5dZEAaBG1U","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"user_permanent","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
